    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the ordinary course of life, our main character comes to a major crossroads when the workplace where he has been working for years closes down overnight. Although his hopes for the future are shaken, his childhood passion will haunt him: Photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the dreams of the past with the realities of the present, our hero decides to open a small photography studio with great potential. He sets out with an old camera and a little savings. On this journey, he will have to demonstrate not only his business skills but also his artistic spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every photo he takes, every satisfied client and every new discovery will make him grow both personally and professionally. But competitors, difficult clients and the ever-changing world of technology are just some of the challenges he will have to overcome along the way. He will have to test his creativity, patience and determination to bring his dream to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442470/extras/0c7287d6c618f534b0ab4b8df50360f9.avif?t=1755471911\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Keep your business expenses under control while capturing the perfect shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442470/extras/e94047fc008738ef0d0911bc579322f4.poster.avif?t=1755471911\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442470/extras/e94047fc008738ef0d0911bc579322f4.webm?t=1755471911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442470/extras/e94047fc008738